# Normalise line endings. Without this, every file this repo is cloned onto
# Windows gets CRLF in the working tree, and the first commit from that
# machine shows every line changed. `text=auto eol=lf` tells git to store
# LF in history and check out LF everywhere, so diffs stay about content.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.jpg binary
